<channel>
<title>FPL Pod</title>
<description><![CDATA[<div>
<p>Welcome to the <strong>FPL Pod</strong>. Join <strong>Kelly Somers, Julien Laurens and Sam Bonfield </strong>ahead of each Gameweek as they discuss and digress about the world of Fantasy Premier League. </p>

<p>After each Gameweek, two Fantasy Premier League experts will discuss all the major talking points and analyse the key decisions in <strong>Off the Bench</strong>.</p>

<p>Hit the subscribe button to ensure you never miss an episode. <br>
