<item>
  <title>S9 Ep3: FPL Pod: Can you go without Erling Haaland?</title>
  <link>https://audioboom.com/posts/8939296</link>
  <itunes:episode>3</itunes:episode>
  <itunes:title>FPL Pod: Can you go without Erling Haaland?</itunes:title>
  <itunes:season>9</itunes:season>
  <enclosure url="https://audioboom.com/posts/8939296.mp3?modified=1786744976&amp;sid=5001585&amp;source=rss" length="45966136" type="audio/mpeg" />
  <itunes:image href="https://audioboom.com/i/43786876/s=1400x1400/el=1/rt=fill.png" />
  <itunes:duration>2858</itunes:duration>
  <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  <itunes:episodeType>full</itunes:episodeType>
  <description><![CDATA[<div>
<p>FPL managers are changing their squad on a daily basis but can you go without the top points-scorer last season, Erling Haaland 💙🤖💙</p><p>That’s the question Kelly Somers and the FPL Pod team attempt to answer as they look at alternative options and how the money could be spent elsewhere.</p><p>LISTEN<br>* Pre-season friendlies (01m 55s)<br>* Yes or no Haaland (08m 00s)<br>* Arsenal attackers (24m 51s)<br>* New manager impact (33m 16s)<br>* Best position picks (40m 53s)<br>* Brilliant Brian Madjo (45m 55s)</p><p>Win our FPL Pod mini-league at the end of the season and get an FPL bundle: q0hv1q</p><p>Follow <a href="https://twitter.com/OfficialFPL">@OfficialFPL on X</a> and <a href="https://www.facebook.com/fantasypremierleague">Facebook<br></a><br><a href="https://twitter.com/KellySomers">Follow Kelly on X</a><br><a href="https://twitter.com/FPLFamily">Follow FPL Family on X</a><br><a href="https://x.com/ianirving_">Follow Ian on X</a></p></div>]]></description>
