  <description><![CDATA[<div>
<p>Pre-season is in full swing and there's plenty for FPL managers to get stuck into ahead of the 26/27 campaign 🔥🙌🔥</p><p>Kelly Somers and the FPL Pod team react to the latest friendlies and transfer activity, update their squad drafts, and reveal chip strategies.</p><p><strong>LISTEN</strong></p></div><ul>
<li>Pre-season friendlies (01m 20s)</li>
<li>Latest transfer reaction (04m 05s)</li>
<li>Best defensive picks (07m 57s)</li>
<li>Midfield debate (14m 52s)</li>
<li>Forward picks (21m 45s)</li>
<li>Chip strategy (27m 20s)</li>
</ul><div>
<p>Win our FPL Pod mini-league at the end of the season and get an FPL bundle: q0hv1q</p><p>Follow <a href="https://twitter.com/OfficialFPL">@OfficialFPL on X</a> and <a href="https://www.facebook.com/fantasypremierleague">Facebook<br></a><br><a href="https://twitter.com/KellySomers">Follow Kelly on X</a><br><a href="https://twitter.com/FPLFamily">Follow FPL Family on X</a><br><a href="https://twitter.com/LaurensJulien">Follow Julien on X</a></p></div>]]></description>
