  <itunes:episodeType>full</itunes:episodeType>
  <description><![CDATA[<div>
<p>We’re back! Kelly Somers is joined by Julien Laurens and Sam Bonfield as the trio examine FPL’s return and look ahead to the 26/27 season 😍🤩😍</p><p>The team discuss rule changes, player position moves, and go through each position building their first squad drafts.</p><p>LISTEN <br>* New rules (09m 07s)<br>* Player position changes (13m 13s)<br>* Goalkeeper options (14m 33s)<br>* Best defensive picks (18m 52s)<br>* Big in midfield (28m 05s)<br>* Who to join Haaland? (36m 29s)</p><p>Win our FPL Pod mini-league at the end of the season and get an FPL bundle: q0hv1q</p><p>Follow <a href="https://twitter.com/OfficialFPL">@OfficialFPL on X</a> and <a href="https://www.facebook.com/fantasypremierleague">Facebook<br></a><br><a href="https://twitter.com/KellySomers">Follow Kelly on X</a><br><a href="https://twitter.com/FPLFamily">Follow FPL Family on X</a><br><a href="https://twitter.com/LaurensJulien">Follow Julien on X</a></p></div>]]></description>
