<item>
  <title>S8 Ep50: FPL Pod: 2025/26 season recap</title>
  <link>https://audioboom.com/posts/8907584</link>
  <itunes:episode>50</itunes:episode>
  <itunes:title>FPL Pod: 2025/26 season recap</itunes:title>
  <itunes:season>8</itunes:season>
  <enclosure url="https://audioboom.com/posts/8907584.mp3?modified=1779710233&amp;sid=5001585&amp;source=rss" length="48575644" type="audio/mpeg" />
  <itunes:image href="https://audioboom.com/i/43662166/s=1400x1400/el=1/rt=fill.png" />
  <itunes:duration>3011</itunes:duration>
  <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  <itunes:episodeType>full</itunes:episodeType>
  <description><![CDATA[<div>
<p>After 380 drama-filled matches, shocking upsets and FPL heartbreak, the 2025/26 Premier League season comes to an end, so Kelly Somers and the FPL Pod team are here to break down every major moment 😍😭🤩</p><p>From the biggest winners to the game-changing new defensive contribution rules, the trio reveal their standout players in every position, revisit their Differential of the Week battle, and come up with FPL resolutions to follow next season.</p><p>LISTEN <br>* Chip impact (16m 15s)<br>* Best defensive options (24m 28s)<br>* Stand out midfielders (35m 49s)<br>* Forward thinking (41m 41s)<br>* Differential of the Week (45m 11s)<br>* Seasons resolutions (47m 43s)</p><p>Congrats to our FPL Pod mini-league winner, Oluwatobi Ajayi 👏</p><p>Follow <a href="https://twitter.com/OfficialFPL">@OfficialFPL on X</a> and <a href="https://www.facebook.com/fantasypremierleague">Facebook<br></a><br><a href="https://twitter.com/KellySomers">Follow Kelly on X</a><br><a href="https://twitter.com/FPLFamily">Follow FPL Family on X</a><br><a href="https://twitter.com/LaurensJulien">Follow Julien on X</a></p></div>]]></description>
  <pubDate>Mon, 25 May 2026 11:53:41 +0000</pubDate>
  <guid isPermaLink="false">audioboom-019e5efb-cfbd-7308-bca5-8ac49ad5f872</guid>
  <itunes:author>Premier League</itunes:author>
  <dc:creator>Premier League</dc:creator>
</item>
<item>
  <title>S8 Ep49: FPL Pod: Finishing the season on a high</title>
  <link>https://audioboom.com/posts/8906303</link>
  <itunes:episode>49</itunes:episode>
  <itunes:title>FPL Pod: Finishing the season on a high</itunes:title>
  <itunes:season>8</itunes:season>
  <enclosure url="https://audioboom.com/posts/8906303.mp3?modified=1779364781&amp;sid=5001585&amp;source=rss" length="40430804" type="audio/mpeg" />
