  <description><![CDATA[<div>
<p>With Gameweek 37 coming to an end, Arsenal look hopeful as they push for the title. <br>🤔😬🤔</p><p>So FPL experts Lee Bonfield and Harry Daniels discuss Arsenal’s defence being the focal point, Fernandes’ record breaking form, and whether to invest in Aston Villa’s attack.</p><p>LISTEN 👇</p></div><ul>
<li>Arsenal Action (03m 00s)</li>
<li>Lacklustre Liverpool? (10m 18s)</li>
