<li>Crystal Palace chaos (23m 55s)</li>
<li>Broken Brighton (29m 07s)</li>
<li>Shaky Spurs(38m 09s)</li>
</ul><div>
<p><br>Win an FPL bundle by topping the FPL Pod mini-league at the end of the season:<br>XY6XPL</p><p>Follow <a href="https://x.com/OfficialFPL">@O@icialFPL</a> on X and <a href="https://www.facebook.com/OfficialFPL/?locale=en_GB">Facebook</a></p><p>Follow <a href="https://x.com/FPL_Harry?lang=en">Harry on X</a></p><p>Follow <a href="https://x.com/FPLFamily">FPL Family on X</a></p></div>]]></description>
