  <itunes:episodeType>full</itunes:episodeType>
  <description><![CDATA[<div>
<p>Arsenal have the title in sight but Man City are close behind, so will the Gunners be going all out attack or holding strong at the back? 🔴🥅⚽️</p><p>That’s the question Kelly Somers and the FPL Pod team discuss as they decide who to invest in, what to do with Man City players, and differential picks for the final two Gameweeks.</p><p>LISTEN <br>* Best Arsenal trio (08m 11s)<br>* Man City dilemma (14m 44s)<br>* Backing Brighton (23m 11s)<br>* Investing in Everton (30m 58s)<br>* Differential of the Week (38m 53s)<br>* Transfers and Captains (40m 43s)</p><p>Win our FPL Pod mini-league at the end of the season and get an FPL bundle: xy6xpl</p><p>Follow <a href="https://twitter.com/OfficialFPL">@OfficialFPL on X</a> and <a href="https://www.facebook.com/fantasypremierleague">Facebook<br></a><br><a href="https://twitter.com/KellySomers">Follow Kelly on X</a><br><a href="https://twitter.com/FPLFamily">Follow FPL Family on X</a><br><a href="https://twitter.com/LaurensJulien">Follow Julien on X</a></p></div>]]></description>
