  <description><![CDATA[<div>
<p>The final Double Gameweek of the season is almost over and there are lessons to learn ahead of the last two rounds of fixtures 🤔🙇🤔</p><p>So FPL experts Prasun Singhal and Sam Bonfield discuss Arsenal's backline over attack, why Man Utd have lots to play for, and whether Brighton are still the team to invest in.</p><p>LISTEN 👇</p><p>* Man City options (03m 51s)<br>* Raya rally (08m 43s)<br>* Chelsea conundrum (21m 40s)<br>* Brighton consideration (25m 39s)<br>* Superb Senesi (32m 29s)<br>* Backing Bruno (36m 56s)</p><p>Win an FPL bundle by topping the FPL Pod mini-league at the end of the season: XY6XPL</p><p>Follow <a href="https://twitter.com/OfficialFPL">@OfficialFPL on X</a> and <a href="https://www.facebook.com/fantasypremierleague">Facebook<br></a><br><a href="https://twitter.com/Pras_fpl">Follow Prasun on X</a><br><a href="https://twitter.com/FPLFamily">Follow FPL Family on X</a></p></div>]]></description>
