<p>It’s the final Double Gameweek of the season and FPL managers are looking to maximise their points for one last time 🤑📈🤑</p><p>So Kelly Somers and the FPL Pod team talk through the best Man City trio picks, if it’s worth investing in Crystal Palace players, and why single Gameweekers might be more tempting buys.</p><p>LISTEN <br>* Best Man City trio (06m 29s)<br>* Palace problems (15m 03s)<br>* Arsenal attackers (21m 12s)<br>* Single Gameweek options (27m 36s)<br>* Differential of the Week (32m 36s)<br>* Transfers and Captains (36m 26s)</p><p>Win our FPL Pod mini-league at the end of the season and get an FPL bundle: xy6xpl</p><p>Follow <a href="https://twitter.com/OfficialFPL">@OfficialFPL on X</a> and <a href="https://www.facebook.com/fantasypremierleague">Facebook<br></a><br><a href="https://twitter.com/KellySomers">Follow Kelly on X</a><br><a href="https://twitter.com/FPLFamily">Follow FPL Family on X</a><br><a href="https://twitter.com/LaurensJulien">Follow Julien on X</a></p></div>]]></description>
