  <itunes:episodeType>full</itunes:episodeType>
  <description><![CDATA[<div>
<p>Bukayo Saka bagged a goal and an assist in a emphatic first-half performance as Arsenal stamped their title credentials. 🏆</p><p>FPL experts Lee Bonfield and Az Phillips discuss an impressive Arsenal performance, another week of returns for Bruno and a title stutter for Man City ahead of their Double Gameweek.</p><p>Listen 🎧</p><p>* Saka x Gyokeres combo (03m 01s)<br>* Another Semenyo blank (10m 44s)<br>* Kroupi’s starring role (17m 50s)<br>* Spurs improvements (25m 37s)<br>* Bruno the best asset (29m 55s)<br>* Chelsea downturn (36m 17s)</p><p>Win an FPL bundle by topping the FPL Pod mini-league at the end of the season: XY6XPL</p><p>Follow <a href="https://twitter.com/OfficialFPL">@OfficialFPL on X</a> and <a href="https://www.facebook.com/fantasypremierleague">Facebook<br></a><br><a href="https://twitter.com/fplblackbox_az">Follow Az on X</a><br><a href="https://twitter.com/FPLFamily">Follow FPL Family on X<br></a><br></p></div>]]></description>
