<p>With Man Utd’s stunning improvement under Michael Carrick, the form of Bruno Fernandes is hard to ignore, especially as captain while Erling Haaland continues to struggle in front of goal ⚽️👹⚽️</p><p>So FPL experts Harry Daniels and Lee Bonfield discuss whether the midfielder deserves the armband full-time, going with two Chelsea attackers, and how Nordi Mukiele could go down in FPL history.</p><p>LISTEN 👇</p><p>* Double Chelsea (04m 07s)<br>* Wirtz decision (10m 05s)<br>* Selling Saka (18m 05s)<br>* Haaland struggles (24m 37s)<br>* Bruno perma-captain (31m 14s)<br>* Mukiele v Lundstrum (48m 00s)</p><p>Win an FPL bundle by topping the FPL Pod mini-league at the end of the season: XY6XPL</p><p>Follow <a href="https://twitter.com/OfficialFPL">@OfficialFPL on X</a> and <a href="https://www.facebook.com/fantasypremierleague">Facebook</a></p><p><a href="https://twitter.com/FPL_Harry">Follow Harry on X</a><br><a href="https://twitter.com/FPLFamily">Follow FPL Family on X</a></p></div>]]></description>
