<p>It’s the hottest topic this Gameweek as FPL managers decide whether to try and capitalise on the favourable fixture changes by using their Wildcard now or save it for later 📈🃏📈</p><p>So Kelly Somers and the FPL Pod team discuss the best players to go after, how to juggle the midfield spots, as well as if we’re starting to have a problem with Erling Haaland.</p><p>LISTEN <br>* European review (04m 50s)<br>* Chelsea investment (10m 42s)<br>* Man Utd double (16m 26s)<br>* Haaland dilemma (26m 30s)<br>* Differential of the Week (39m 17s)<br>* Transfers and captains (40m 47s)</p><p>Win our FPL Pod mini-league at the end of the season and get an FPL bundle: xy6xpl</p><p>Follow <a href="https://twitter.com/OfficialFPL">@OfficialFPL on X</a> and <a href="https://www.facebook.com/fantasypremierleague">Facebook<br></a><br><a href="https://twitter.com/KellySomers">Follow Kelly on X</a><br><a href="https://twitter.com/FPLFamily">Follow FPL Family on X</a><br><a href="https://twitter.com/LaurensJulien">Follow Julien on X</a></p></div>]]></description>
