<p>The final Gameweek of a busy set of festive fixtures is almost complete, ahead of an FA Cup weekend, but it’s been a huge few days as drastic changes are made 😮🚨😮</p><p>Kelly Somers and the FPL Pod team look at the managerial moves at Chelsea and Man Utd, why it could be time to mix up your Man City assets, and there’s a surprise Chip activated by one of our pundits.</p><p>LISTEN 👇</p><p>* Manager changes (05m 48s)<br>* Thiago must have (15m 58s)<br>* Selling Everton defence (23m 48s)<br>* Man City conundrum (27m 07s)<br>* Brilliant Bruno Guimaraes (34m 58s)<br>* Wildcard team reveal (37m 15s)</p><p>Win our FPL Pod mini-league at the end of the season and get an FPL bundle: xy6xpl</p><p>Follow <a href="https://twitter.com/OfficialFPL">@OfficialFPL on X</a> and <a href="https://www.facebook.com/fantasypremierleague">Facebook</a></p><p><a href="https://twitter.com/KellySomers">Follow Kelly on X</a><br><a href="https://twitter.com/FPLFamily">Follow FPL Family on X</a><br><a href="https://twitter.com/LaurensJulien">Follow Julien on X</a></p></div>]]></description>
