  <description><![CDATA[<div>More midweek matches are upon us as we near the end of the festive fixtures, but rotation and the absence of some popular players has got FPL managers looking to change up their squads 🤷‍♀️🤔🤷<br><br>So Kelly Somers and the FPL Pod team debate Declan Rice’s importance after his incredible haul while Bukayo Saka sat on the bench, what to do with Hugo Ekitike after he was missing from Liverpool’s team, and if it’s time to get Ollie Watkins or Igor Thiago back in our sides.<br><br>LISTEN 👇<br><br>* In-form Watkins (05m 42s)<br>* Arsenal assets(16m 08s)<br>* Ekitike issues (28m 00s)<br>* Man City conundrum (36m 43s)<br>* Differential of the Week (42m 19s)<br>* Transfer and captains (44m 07s)<br><br>Win our FPL Pod mini-league at the end of the season and get an FPL bundle: xy6xp<br><br>Follow <a href="https://twitter.com/OfficialFPL">@OfficialFPL on X</a> and <a href="https://www.facebook.com/fantasypremierleague">Facebook</a><br><br><a href="https://twitter.com/KellySomers">Follow Kelly on X</a><br><a href="https://twitter.com/FPLFamily">Follow FPL Family on X</a><br><a href="https://twitter.com/LaurensJulien">Follow Julien on X</a><br><br>*This episode of the FPL Pod was recorded before the announcement of Ruben Amorim's departure from Man Utd.</div>]]></description>
