  <description><![CDATA[<div>Off the back of Blank Gameweek 29, FPL Managers now face a long wait until Gameweek 30 with an international break and an FA Cup weekend taking place. 😫<br><br>Kelly Somers and the FPL Pod team are making sure to use that time wisely as they discuss some Wildcard options, focusing on the best goalkeeper and defenders to add to your squad.<br><br>LISTEN 🎧<br><br>* BGW29 review (00m 35s)<br>* Chip strategies (09m 13s)<br>* Best goalkeepers (17m 48s)<br>* Avoid the Liverpool defence (26m 30s)<br>* Double Arsenal defence (31m 10s)<br>* Best five defenders (40m 15s)<br><br>Win our FPL Pod mini-league at the end of the season and get an FPL bundle: q7yco0<br><br>Follow <a href="https://twitter.com/OfficialFPL">@OfficialFPL on X</a> and <a href="https://www.facebook.com/fantasypremierleague">Facebook</a><br><br><a href="https://twitter.com/KellySomers">Follow Kelly on X<br></a><a href="https://twitter.com/FPLFamily">Follow FPL Family on X<br></a><a href="https://twitter.com/LaurensJulien">Follow Julien on X</a>
