  <description><![CDATA[<div><strong>FPLPod International Break </strong></div><div><br></div><div>The latest Official Fantasy Premier League Podcast is here as James Richardson and guests look ahead to Gameweek 14.</div><div><br></div><div>James is joined by broadcaster and former football Adrian Clarke, football writer for The Telegraph JJ Bull, and fantasy expert Geoff Dance from Fantasy Football Scout to discuss GW14’s difficult captaincy decision.</div><div><br></div><div>They consider the various options at Tottenham, injuries worries for Abraham and Aguero, and answer listener questions about differential options sent in using the hashtag #FPLPod.</div><div><br></div><div>Finally, the team reveal their transfer plans for GW14!<br><br>RUNNING ORDER<br>0.32 - Intro<br>4.50 - GW 13<br>16.28 - Long View<br>21.42 -  Listener Questions &amp; Essential Differential<br>27.03 - Transfers &amp; Captains</div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div><strong>The Official FPL Podcast</strong></div><div>League code: 6qp8qk</div><div><br></div><div><a href="https://fantasy.premierleague.com/leagues/763732/standings/c">https://fantasy.premierleague.com/leagues/763732/standings/c</a></div><div><br></div><div>59thth overall, leader liban maawiye’s Team mr Lee’ goes top after 73 points in GW13.</div><div>The Team: <a href="https://fantasy.premierleague.com/entry/3667103/history">https://fantasy.premierleague.com/entry/3667103/history</a>
</div><div><br></div><div><strong>The Official FPL Podcast (Guests)</strong></div><div><a href="https://fantasy.premierleague.com/leagues/730132/standings/c">https://fantasy.premierleague.com/leagues/730132/standings/c</a></div><div><br></div><div>Julien Laurens extends his lead over Sam Bonfield at the top after 75 points in GW13: </div><div>The team: <a href="https://fantasy.premierleague.com/entry/2496505/history">https://fantasy.premierleague.com/entry/2496505/history</a>
</div><div><br></div><div>For more great FPL content from the Premier League check out FPLFYI on YouTube</div><div>(<a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=F-FTkKjiEIw">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=F-FTkKjiEIw</a>) and the FPL Show </div>]]></description>
