  <itunes:episodeType>full</itunes:episodeType>
  <description><![CDATA[<div>The latest Official Fantasy Premier League Podcast is here as James Richardson and guests look ahead to Gameweek 10.</div><div><br></div><div>James is joined by Sam Parkin from talkSPORT’s GameDay coverage of the Premier League, Tom Williams from ESPN and Bleacher Report, and FPL expert Geoff Dance to discuss well performing differential picks.</div><div><br></div><div>They also discuss strong Manchester City captaincy picks and back Watford to soon find form, before fielding listener questions sent in using the hashtag #FPLPod.</div><div><br></div><div>Finally, the team reveal their Gameweek 10 transfer plans!</div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div><strong>The Official FPL Podcast</strong></div><div>League code: 6qp8qk</div><div><br></div><div><a href="https://fantasy.premierleague.com/leagues/763732/standings/c">https://fantasy.premierleague.com/leagues/763732/standings/c</a></div><div><br></div><div>31st overall, the leader is Kristian Nagel Anderson with the team ‘Buggebakken City’.</div><div>His Team: <a href="https://fantasy.premierleague.com/entry/407362/history">https://fantasy.premierleague.com/entry/407362/history</a>
</div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div><strong>The Official FPL Podcast (Guests)</strong></div><div><a href="https://fantasy.premierleague.com/leagues/730132/standings/c">https://fantasy.premierleague.com/leagues/730132/standings/c</a></div><div><br></div><div>Sam Bonfield takes the top spot from Jack Lang in the Guests League:</div><div>Her team: <a href="https://fantasy.premierleague.com/entry/32044/history">https://fantasy.premierleague.com/entry/32044/history</a>
</div><div><br></div><div>For more great FPL content from the Premier League check out FPLFYI on YouTube</div><div>(link) and the FPL Show (link).<br><br>00.33 - Intro</div><div>05.24 - Gameweek 10</div><div>14.24 - Longview</div><div>18.21 - Your Questions</div><div>23.07 - Essential Differentials</div><div>27.00 - Last-Minute Plans</div>]]></description>
